# MCP tool names and what the pre-tool hook decides for each, one
# "<deny|ask|allow> <tool name>" per line. The state is the one
# commands.cases uses. The names cover every form seen on this machine and
# the trackers the plan names.
#
# Posting: comment, reply, review, reaction, send_message, post_message,
# schedule_message.
